# Answers to "what is everyone's craft?" (0.36-se.4).
@kind reply
@answers ask_craft
@who *
armorcraft, someone always needs armor
weaponcraft, slow to level but people pay well
tailoring, cloth and leather for half the realm
spellcraft, but only if you have coin to burn
fletching, archers keep me in business
